Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator and editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:57.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistants:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:03:02.14,nicks,,0,0,0,,Typesetter translators: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.50,0:01:00.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Is this the alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.52,0:01:19.98,voiceover,,0,0,0,,My soul is moving now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Soul has not moved
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.89,0:03:12.26,general text,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:23.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.44,0:03:27.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.86,0:03:30.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.17,0:03:48.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Kil Ju, you switched bodies with my student
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:51.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:58.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I was weak to protect him from you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.89,0:04:01.35,general text,,0,0,0,,But I will definitely finish you off
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:08.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.24,0:04:11.24,general text,,0,0,0,,why were you so worried about Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.99,0:04:13.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.58,0:04:18.70,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s me, Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:20.87,general text,,0,0,0,,We have not changed
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:25.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Look into my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.80,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:35.05,general text,,0,0,0,,The only one who can look at you from such a distance
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:40.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.68,0:06:04.02,general text,,0,0,0,,He has a mark on his shoulder
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:08.69,general text,,0,0,0,,His soul apparently returned back to his body
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.77,0:06:11.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Then why am I okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.15,0:06:12.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.82,0:06:14.40,general text,,0,0,0,,You have changed too. Look
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.91,general text,,0,0,0,,You are not wearing a bracelet, but your hand is not shaking
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:23.45,general text,,0,0,0,,You're right. I can move it freely
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:25.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Reflector helped gain energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.00,0:06:29.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Poison opened your gates, reflect increased energy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.79,0:06:34.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, you are incredibly lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.60,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw you there
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:45.64,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:09.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.84,general text,,0,0,0,,You failed because of your weak energy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.92,0:07:15.05,general text,,0,0,0,,You are also a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:16.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su you too
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.93,general text,,0,0,0,,you will petrify and die
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.05,0:07:23.05,general text,,0,0,0,,How I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.26,0:07:25.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Like your father
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:31.90,general text,,0,0,0,,My father?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:33.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:36.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Stargazer Mage
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.53,0:07:38.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Cho Chun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.03,general text,,0,0,0,,My father...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:46.29,general text,,0,0,0,,was a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:53.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Your family was not killed by the main families of Deho
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.13,0:07:59.26,general text,,0,0,0,,It was your father. He turned into a soul swallower and killed everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.39,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Stay inside and don’t go out
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:06.39,memories,,0,0,0,,If you see your father, run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.10,memories,,0,0,0,,Don't let him catch you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.48,0:08:15.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Both you and your father were used
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:18.78,general text,,0,0,0,,You will petrify and die
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.74,general text,,0,0,0,,My father was a nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.11,0:08:24.28,general text,,0,0,0,,did Dan Zhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:27.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Moo from Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:30.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu is not the real Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:34.54,general text,,0,0,0,,True Dan Zhu is someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.46,0:08:37.67,general text,,0,0,0,,- And who is this?\N- Real
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:41.34,general text,,0,0,0,,can stop petrification
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.34,0:08:45.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Because he has an ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Who is the real Dan Zhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:14.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:17.17,general text,,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:19.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Run after him. Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.71,0:09:59.04,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.71,0:10:01.71,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,until the poison from witchcraft spreads
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.15,0:10:27.32,italics,,0,0,0,,View all
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.41,0:10:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.26,0:10:53.22,general text,,0,0,0,,No one
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:00.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I felt the energy of witchcraft
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.77,0:11:03.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho was right. This sapsari is Gwigu
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:06.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Is there really an alchemy of souls here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:16.79,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.37,0:11:18.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Lying on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.87,0:11:21.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a reflector
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This bracelet...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.01,0:11:31.01,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Mr. Chan Wook’s bracelet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.09,0:11:32.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:34.97,general text,,0,0,0,,So Uk was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:40.98,general text,,0,0,0,,They fought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:43.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you think something happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Return to Sosnovy Bor and report what you saw
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.78,0:11:52.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu, come and look for Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:54.03,general text,,0,0,0,,- I'll look in the area\N- Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,How did the magicians of Sosnovy Bor find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.55,0:12:51.30,memories italics,,0,0,0,,You are a nomad too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:53.59,memories,,0,0,0,,Nak Su, you too
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:56.72,memories,,0,0,0,,you will petrify and die
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:58.81,memories,,0,0,0,,Like me
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.06,memories,,0,0,0,,Like your father
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.77,0:13:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:31.96,memories italics,,0,0,0,,And you and your father
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.22,memories italics,,0,0,0,,used. You'll turn to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:39.81,memories italics,,0,0,0,,and you die
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:27.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:29.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Why you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:39.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Is this a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.30,0:15:41.30,general text,,0,0,0,,No, maid Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I accidentally wounded her, she should be taken to the healers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.07,general text,,0,0,0,,What a day this is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Trade was going well
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:05.08,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I need to replenish my energy, otherwise I’ll completely petrify
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.75,0:16:09.79,italics,,0,0,0,,- Finished?\N- That’s it already
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:12.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Shall we have a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:13.92,italics,,0,0,0,,- Okay\N- Quicker
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.00,0:16:15.17,italics,,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.84,0:16:19.13,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to come back if I create a fuss
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:22.13,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I need to find a quiet place where I can get enough
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.85,0:17:14.65,italics,,0,0,0,,Move away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:17.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, oh, come on in
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:19.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:22.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You will not deceive us with these tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.45,0:17:25.99,general text,,0,0,0,,You have been following her since you entered the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.50,0:17:35.83,memories,,0,0,0,,This man is haunting us
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:42.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You followed her all the way to the inn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:47.43,general text,,0,0,0,,We were just in one direction
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:48.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t lie
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:51.52,general text,,0,0,0,,You were staring at her the whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.60,0:17:52.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:53.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Song Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.52,0:17:56.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t embarrass him
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:03.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I was uncomfortable with you following me, and it was also rude on your part
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.15,0:18:07.11,general text,,0,0,0,,If you don’t want me to look for another inn,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:08.32,general text,,0,0,0,,go away
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.87,0:18:11.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Girl
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:14.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you decide that I follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:16.79,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t owe me anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.87,0:18:20.13,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t even know you, why should I pursue you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:23.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Because she is very...\N- Shut up, Sun Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.72,0:18:26.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Let her answer
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.51,0:18:32.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I had a lot of problems because of men who followed me because of my beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.81,0:18:33.97,general text,,0,0,0,,So I decided,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:36.81,general text,,0,0,0,,that you are one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:38.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.15,0:18:39.98,general text,,0,0,0,,But this is not so
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.36,0:18:43.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Beauty did not impress
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:46.20,general text,,0,0,0,,And I didn’t follow you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:49.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Well then,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.20,0:18:52.54,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.62,0:18:54.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Can I go up then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.05,0:19:09.47,general text,,0,0,0,,- Mrs. Ho\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.55,0:19:11.18,general text,,0,0,0,,You must eat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:14.39,general text,,0,0,0,,This bastard...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:16.43,general text,,0,0,0,,That is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.02,0:19:19.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you embarrassed because you might cross paths with him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:22.44,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I just don’t feel good
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.48,0:19:27.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Change into dry clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll bring you some porridge
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.38,0:21:11.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.72,general text,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:20.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you follow him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.43,0:21:22.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:26.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you weren't hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.94,0:21:28.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:30.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.78,general text,,0,0,0,,If you feel bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.57,0:21:35.32,general text,,0,0,0,,go to Sejukwon in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.41,0:21:36.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you know about Saejukwon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.03,0:21:38.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm from Sejukwon...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.87,0:21:44.58,general text,,0,0,0,,I am Ho Young Ok
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:06.98,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Instead of a friend nearby, you have a whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.23,0:22:10.11,memories italics,,0,0,0,,So your friend left you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:14.90,general text,,0,0,0,,You knew
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.95,0:22:18.45,general text,,0,0,0,,who am I all this time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.72,0:23:20.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.05,0:23:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Hey, how are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.85,0:23:25.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Try to get up. Slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.27,0:23:30.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.90,0:23:33.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Soul Swallower!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.02,0:23:35.11,general text,,0,0,0,,It's a soul swallower!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.19,0:23:37.44,general text,,0,0,0,,- Soul Swallow\N- Soul Swallower!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:13.44,memories,,0,0,0,,True Dan Zhu is someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.44,0:24:18.11,memories,,0,0,0,,The real one can stop petrification
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.19,0:24:20.95,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Yes, go to your Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:24.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Is Kil Zhu missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.91,0:24:28.66,general text,,0,0,0,,We don't know where he is since he went after Chan Wook's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:31.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Chang Wook’s maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:34.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Why does he need her?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:37.92,general text,,0,0,0,,To be honest, he was following Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.96,0:24:42.68,general text,,0,0,0,,The spirit amulet that remained after Nak Soo belonged to Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.43,0:24:46.56,general text,,0,0,0,,He probably thought that Chan Wook was somehow connected with her
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.64,0:24:48.89,general text,,0,0,0,,You should have told me earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.52,0:24:50.77,general text,,0,0,0,,He says to be silent
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.85,0:24:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably wanted to find solid evidence
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.77,0:24:55.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell all magicians to find Kil Ju
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.15,0:25:03.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook's bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.91,0:25:06.37,general text,,0,0,0,,found where they performed the alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:07.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu is looking for Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.04,0:25:10.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Master So examines the surroundings of the temple
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.16,0:25:12.79,general text,,0,0,0,,- They were in the temple?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.87,0:25:16.92,general text,,0,0,0,,I doubt that Uk is capable of alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:18.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.42,0:25:20.92,general text,,0,0,0,,what if someone’s soul migrated to Uka’s body?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.01,0:25:23.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. I'm sure he's fine
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.39,0:25:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,She will protect him
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:31.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Where
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.89,0:25:35.60,general text,,0,0,0,,our head, when is there such chaos here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:38.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Before Uk was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.98,0:25:42.03,general text,,0,0,0,,20 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.61,0:25:43.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.49,0:25:46.32,general text,,0,0,0,,conducted alchemy of souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.58,0:25:53.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Jeonbugwan and witchcraft?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.67,0:25:56.00,general text,,0,0,0,,This is just funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:25:57.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu told me about this
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.92,0:26:00.96,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t dare ask him,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.38,0:26:03.97,general text,,0,0,0,,that’s why I came to you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.43,0:26:09.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Miss Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.06,0:26:12.77,general text,,0,0,0,,worried that Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.77,0:26:16.69,general text,,0,0,0,,interested in some strange spells
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.52,0:26:20.82,general text,,0,0,0,,But it didn’t last long
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.40,0:26:23.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Gwangju hasn’t been home for a year
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.28,0:26:27.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Trained spells with Jin Moo in Jeonbugwan's secret room
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.91,0:26:28.87,general text,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.95,0:26:32.74,general text,,0,0,0,,he stopped when his wife got pregnant
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.67,0:26:40.54,memories italics,,0,0,0,,He is the son of a deceased king
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:42.30,memories,,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.80,memories,,0,0,0,,died due to illness, unable to move
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.26,memories,,0,0,0,,How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.22,0:26:52.68,memories,,0,0,0,,This is possible due to the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.64,0:26:56.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Being a magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.35,0:26:59.52,general text,,0,0,0,,he was burning with a simple interest in such things
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.60,0:27:00.52,general text,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:03.15,general text,,0,0,0,,He committed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.65,0:27:05.90,general text,,0,0,0,,something irreparable
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:10.70,general text,,0,0,0,,with the lives of Do Hwa and Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.00,0:27:24.38,general text,,0,0,0,,The magician from Chongjingak is urgently looking for our master
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.18,0:27:35.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know you were here, uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.97,0:27:37.27,general text,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.44,0:27:39.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:42.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk fell victim to the alchemy of souls
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.36,0:27:44.44,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.84,0:28:10.22,italics,,0,0,0,,This is Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.76,0:28:13.72,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,The real Dan Zhu is behind these walls?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.91,0:28:39.50,general text,,0,0,0,,This is the road to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.33,0:28:43.17,general text,,0,0,0,,Is the real Dan Zhu there?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.97,0:28:54.14,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm from Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.85,0:28:56.60,general text,,0,0,0,,This is probably urgent
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.77,0:29:06.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Show your face
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.11,0:29:08.02,general text,,0,0,0,,This is urgent. Out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.11,0:29:09.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Show your face first
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.92,0:29:32.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Soul Swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.93,0:29:37.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Behind it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.70,0:31:28.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Real in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.42,0:31:32.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Ice stone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.92,0:31:35.46,general text,,0,0,0,,You mentioned him
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.13,0:31:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find him and save her from a similar fate to you
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.50,0:32:12.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait, he...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:15.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.34,0:32:16.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Is he really dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.96,0:32:18.76,general text,,0,0,0,,- Touch\N- Is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.86,0:32:38.86,general text,,0,0,0,,He tried to get into the palace until he turned to stone
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.74,0:32:41.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:44.45,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare we?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.53,0:32:47.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Suddenly some unknown magician appeared and killed him
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.12,0:32:50.37,general text,,0,0,0,,What family is he from? Have you seen the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.45,0:32:52.00,general text,,0,0,0,,No, it was hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.08,0:32:54.75,general text,,0,0,0,,But I saw that he used
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.21,0:33:02.38,italics,,0,0,0,,It was Tansu
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.84,0:33:08.72,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tansu?\N- Yes, I'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.85,0:33:11.39,general text,,0,0,0,,He hit with energy from the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.10,0:33:17.19,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Tangsu was owned by Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.27,0:33:20.27,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Was there someone else who mastered it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.33,0:33:31.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you caught the soulswallower
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.45,0:33:35.75,general text,,0,0,0,,We came to see who it is
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.04,0:33:39.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course. You can look
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.86,0:34:04.99,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Kil Ju,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.86,0:34:08.66,general text,,0,0,0,,one of your people
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.58,0:34:12.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Correct
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.20,0:34:17.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Bring in the body and get everyone out
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.92,0:34:18.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.42,0:34:27.59,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu was with me when they performed alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.43,0:34:30.01,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He is also confused
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.01,0:34:34.47,offscreen,,0,0,0,,He didn’t know that they had performed alchemy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.18,0:34:39.56,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it since everything happened in Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.65,0:34:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,No relation to Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.07,0:34:43.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.90,0:34:46.86,general text,,0,0,0,,If necessary, we will provide assistance
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.45,0:34:49.78,general text,,0,0,0,,If necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.37,0:34:54.83,italics,,0,0,0,,Another nomad turned into a soulswallow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.41,0:34:58.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, he was caught and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.62,0:35:00.63,general text,,0,0,0,,And who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.71,0:35:01.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Kil Ju,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.00,0:35:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,magician Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.05,0:35:09.18,italics,,0,0,0,,Kil Zhu became a nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.18,0:35:13.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Jonbugwan caught him?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.35,0:35:15.35,general text,,0,0,0,,He was caught in front of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.43,0:35:18.48,general text,,0,0,0,,He tried to get into the palace when he was running wild
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.44,0:35:21.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Did he come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.23,0:35:23.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Suddenly a magician appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.48,0:35:25.61,general text,,0,0,0,,which Tansu used
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:30.99,general text,,0,0,0,,And who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.53,0:35:34.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Kil Ju killed Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.74,0:35:35.99,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Nak Su?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.08,0:35:37.50,general text,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.58,0:35:39.46,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nak Su?\N- Mercenary?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:44.04,general text,,0,0,0,,A magician wielding Tansu who appeared in front of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.13,0:35:45.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su owned it
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.00,0:35:47.71,italics,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- Amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.80,0:35:49.17,general text,,0,0,0,,- Was it her?\N- Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:50.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.63,0:35:51.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su is dead
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.05,0:35:52.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.01,0:35:55.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone here saw how her body was burned
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.01,0:35:58.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I saw it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.43,0:35:59.60,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yes\N- Exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.68,0:36:02.10,general text,,0,0,0,,The body is burned, but the soul is alive
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.19,0:36:05.57,general text,,0,0,0,,The shadow warrior has become a nomad!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.65,0:36:07.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:09.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- It can’t be\N- Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.40,0:36:11.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But Nak Soo is a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.36,0:36:13.41,general text,,0,0,0,,And Kil Ju was killed by a young man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.49,0:36:16.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Tall young man in a blue robe
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.33,0:36:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su is a nomad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.41,0:36:22.08,general text,,0,0,0,,She could migrate into the body of this young man
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.88,0:36:25.79,general text,,0,0,0,,And then I became stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.30,0:36:28.96,general text,,0,0,0,,She was strong
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.05,0:36:32.51,general text,,0,0,0,,But in the body of a man it became even stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.72,0:36:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,The murder of Kil Ju is her revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.22,0:36:38.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan for the burned body
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:40.85,general text,,0,0,0,,and the murder of her people
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.93,0:36:42.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Why should we take revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:44.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine Forest killed Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.31,0:36:50.07,general text,,0,0,0,,"Clad in blue, the incredible Nak Soo has returned"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.15,0:36:52.74,general text,,0,0,0,,"Pine Forest is her next goal"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.82,0:36:55.99,general text,,0,0,0,,These are the rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.07,0:36:58.95,general text,,0,0,0,,The soul swallower was caught just a couple of hours ago
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.04,0:37:00.83,general text,,0,0,0,,and already such absurd rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.41,0:37:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Such rumors are as fast as wildfire
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.29,0:37:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,And the rumors are not groundless
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:10.00,general text,,0,0,0,,The magician used Tansa,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.09,0:37:12.47,general text,,0,0,0,,like Nak Su
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.55,0:37:14.47,general text,,0,0,0,,And she was the only one who owned it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.05,0:37:18.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I would like to, I’ve mastered it right now
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.56,0:37:23.27,general text,,0,0,0,,If these rumors spread throughout Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.35,0:37:26.44,general text,,0,0,0,,you will answer. Make sure this doesn't happen
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.23,0:37:28.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.65,0:37:34.65,general text,,0,0,0,,What a blessing that you became a soul swallower
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.74,0:37:36.16,general text,,0,0,0,,not a young master
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.07,0:37:40.28,general text,,0,0,0,,But why did we find his bracelet there?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.95,0:37:44.16,general text,,0,0,0,,We'll know when we find it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.21,0:37:52.76,general text,,0,0,0,,You look bad
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.05,0:38:01.39,general text,,0,0,0,,You should
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.14,0:38:04.48,general text,,0,0,0,,go home and wait for him there
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.82,0:38:16.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling unwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.15,0:38:20.20,general text,,0,0,0,,I was so surprised that the honey cookies I ate yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.28,0:38:22.29,general text,,0,0,0,,still in my throat
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.33,0:38:27.29,general text,,0,0,0,,I was so scared when I heard about the soul swallower,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.37,0:38:29.71,general text,,0,0,0,,that the soul first left the body and then returned
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.84,0:38:40.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Is the truth back?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.18,0:38:44.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Is that you, maid Kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.35,0:38:47.85,general text,,0,0,0,,No, chapter. I'm Pak's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.06,0:38:52.69,general text,,0,0,0,,I could have hit the young master on the back, which scares me so much
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.78,0:38:56.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Hit me instead
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.57,0:39:01.16,general text,,0,0,0,,I give permission to Maid Pak
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.74,0:39:02.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.91,0:39:04.66,general text,,0,0,0,,My hands are strong
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.74,0:39:06.70,general text,,0,0,0,,It will hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.58,0:39:09.79,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t cry,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.87,0:39:11.17,general text,,0,0,0,,beat
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.80,0:39:17.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Consider that you’ve already hit me once
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.05,0:39:20.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.05,0:39:23.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Will you do something unpleasant to me in response?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.26,0:39:25.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Then I cancel this blow
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.85,0:39:27.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Hit me too
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.02,0:39:29.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.10,0:39:31.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurry
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:38.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.20,0:39:41.86,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.24,0:39:46.20,general text,,0,0,0,,As the head of Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.45,0:39:50.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll have to act cold and heartless
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.08,0:39:52.42,general text,,0,0,0,,But I really
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.54,0:39:55.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t want to hurt you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.88,0:40:02.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.76,0:40:06.22,general text,,0,0,0,,what did they ask me about Master Chang Gan yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.81,0:40:08.77,general text,,0,0,0,,A lot has happened
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.85,0:40:10.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Being the head, I couldn’t
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.85,0:40:13.81,general text,,0,0,0,,be objective
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.77,0:40:16.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Your blow brought me to my senses
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.73,0:40:20.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Now we must act wisely
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.12,0:40:27.03,general text,,0,0,0,,You can calmly beat me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.37,0:40:29.95,general text,,0,0,0,,as Pak's maid
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.87,0:40:33.04,general text,,0,0,0,,From you
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.04,0:40:35.63,general text,,0,0,0,,I will accept
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.81,0:40:53.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.23,0:40:55.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Ho said to find out where the witchcraft is coming from
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.86,0:40:58.15,general text,,0,0,0,,And on the spot I found this
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.15,0:41:01.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Lost, apparently
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.70,0:41:04.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You don’t need it anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.28,0:41:07.07,general text,,0,0,0,,No, not anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.78,0:41:10.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Almost lost the Jin family treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.33,0:41:12.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks for finding it
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.00,0:41:15.71,general text,,0,0,0,,You've lost something else
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.00,0:41:18.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you going to look for Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.88,0:41:21.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.67,0:41:25.30,general text,,0,0,0,,I found her when she was hiding in the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.76,0:41:29.68,general text,,0,0,0,,She was wounded and bleeding
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.99,0:41:45.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.62,0:41:48.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.33,0:41:51.79,general text,,0,0,0,,how could you leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.87,0:41:52.87,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.62,0:41:58.08,general text,,0,0,0,,You ran away, leaving me
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.92,0:42:00.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Play along with me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.13,0:42:07.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes... I ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.80,0:42:08.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.84,0:42:12.14,general text,,0,0,0,,We encountered a soul swallower while hiding from the rain
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.22,0:42:13.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.60,0:42:16.89,general text,,0,0,0,,this soul swallower almost devoured me
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.40,0:42:20.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.02,0:42:25.74,general text,,0,0,0,,I was so scared that I couldn’t think about anything and ran away
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:30.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul mistook Moo Deok for a soul swallower and almost killed him
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.37,0:42:34.41,general text,,0,0,0,,If he had not taken care of her, Moo Deok would have died
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.96,0:42:41.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Yul,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.50,0:42:45.42,general text,,0,0,0,,thank you for saving Moo Deok and taking care of her
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.30,0:42:53.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you really run away, leaving her?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.89,0:43:00.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I would die
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.36,0:43:02.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you only have to think about yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.32,0:43:06.40,general text,,0,0,0,,What are you watching? Don't agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.78,0:43:10.03,general text,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm glad,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.11,0:43:12.83,general text,,0,0,0,,that we are both fine
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.42,0:43:23.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.55,0:43:31.39,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you were hiding in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.97,0:43:33.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what our leader said?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.93,0:43:36.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Pine forest will bear your shame
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.14,0:43:37.64,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.39,0:43:40.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Why, if I’m not even a member of Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.89,0:43:43.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Duel with the prince in two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.65,0:43:47.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t show up in the city until then, don’t cause problems
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:48.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep your head down
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.53,0:43:56.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Thank you for taking care of me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.87,0:43:58.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, Uk copes well without a bracelet
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.04,0:44:02.25,general text,,0,0,0,,I think he can control energy now
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.54,0:44:07.42,general text,,0,0,0,,He risked his life again and got what he wanted
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.50,0:44:09.01,general text,,0,0,0,,And you were there again
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.80,0:44:15.60,general text,,0,0,0,,If it bothered you that much, you would have left me to die
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.22,0:44:17.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.10,0:44:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,next time
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.36,0:44:28.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.65,0:44:30.90,general text,,0,0,0,,I’m coming, master
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.66,0:44:34.70,general text,,0,0,0,,We're off
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.58,0:44:42.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk was not wounded
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.54,0:44:44.46,general text,,0,0,0,,That’s good
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.38,0:44:47.29,general text,,0,0,0,,He saw
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.38,0:44:49.88,general text,,0,0,0,,who was with Kil Ju when he changed souls?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.96,0:44:52.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Probably the guy in blue
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.97,0:44:55.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk was too busy running to look
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.47,0:44:57.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Did you ask his maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.60,0:45:00.35,general text,,0,0,0,,She must have seen the spells
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.35,0:45:04.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.61,0:45:12.78,general text,,0,0,0,,If she saw it, she hardly knows what it is
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.99,0:45:16.74,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an ordinary maid who knows little about magic
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.41,0:45:21.58,general text,,0,0,0,,What about the hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.33,0:45:24.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.71,0:45:29.75,general text,,0,0,0,,There was poison from witchcraft in the reflector that I touched
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.59,0:45:31.67,general text,,0,0,0,,But I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.34,0:45:34.72,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll go
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.84,0:46:14.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you want to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.55,0:46:20.76,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard you took my wedding gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.39,0:46:22.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.81,0:46:25.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Afraid that I would destroy them?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.02,0:46:30.02,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll save them until your next wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.56,0:46:31.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Throw them away
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.07,0:46:34.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Marriage is no longer my priority
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.40,0:46:37.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t be so embarrassed
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.61,0:46:42.12,general text,,0,0,0,,The wedding was prepared secretly, few people knew about it
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.16,0:46:45.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.37,0:46:49.50,italics,,0,0,0,,Cho Young!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.13,0:46:54.88,general text,,0,0,0,,They say you are getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.67,0:46:58.80,general text,,0,0,0,,I heard about gifts, and that I found a craftsman to make rings
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.34,0:47:02.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the rumors have spread
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.18,0:47:03.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.18,0:47:05.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, young master Pak
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.10,0:47:08.77,general text,,0,0,0,,- Me?\N- I know that you are the one getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.85,0:47:10.69,italics,,0,0,0,,He received gifts
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.77,0:47:12.61,italics,,0,0,0,,I went with you to try on rings
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.69,0:47:13.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.90,0:47:16.74,general text,,0,0,0,,There were absurd rumors that you were marrying Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.32,0:47:18.28,italics,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.36,0:47:20.03,italics,,0,0,0,,You two are getting married
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.70,0:47:22.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes, that’s right
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.82,0:47:24.74,general text,,0,0,0,,But don’t talk about it
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.83,0:47:26.25,general text,,0,0,0,,It’s still a secret
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.87,0:47:28.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.62,0:47:29.79,general text,,0,0,0,,See you
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.04,0:47:33.42,general text,,0,0,0,,I told you it was Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.50,0:47:36.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Exactly. She's not crazy to marry Uka again
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.67,0:47:38.26,italics,,0,0,0,,Don’t say
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.93,0:47:42.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Dan Gu
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.09,0:47:43.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Why did you confirm their words?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.47,0:47:46.77,general text,,0,0,0,,This is better than admitting that Uk rejected you twice
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.39,0:47:50.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's say that this time you refused to marry me
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.27,0:47:52.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Still, these will only be rumors
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.69,0:47:55.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Do you agree to this arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.94,0:47:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,You’ll be embarrassed
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.74,0:48:00.95,general text,,0,0,0,,I agree
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.93,0:48:29.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Stink Mu Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.48,0:48:33.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you back here again? Weren't you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.94,0:48:35.94,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.86,0:48:40.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Forget. Move away
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.53,0:48:47.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Looking for Moo Deok again?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.78,0:48:50.54,general text,,0,0,0,,No. The dress just looked familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.87,0:48:54.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok sold it to us
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.08,0:48:57.09,general text,,0,0,0,,- Sold?\N- Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.17,0:49:00.09,general text,,0,0,0,,She said it was a gift from a frivolous man
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.17,0:49:01.59,general text,,0,0,0,,And also that it is provided
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.67,0:49:03.63,general text,,0,0,0,,and will not require the dress back
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.26,0:49:07.89,general text,,0,0,0,,Did she really say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.97,0:49:11.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Yes. Stink Moo Deok and silk can't go hand in hand
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.73,0:49:13.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Watch your language
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.73,0:49:15.60,general text,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.69,0:49:19.07,general text,,0,0,0,,I gave her this name and only I can call her that
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.15,0:49:20.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Not you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.23,0:49:22.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.99,0:49:25.07,general text,,0,0,0,,And also
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.16,0:49:29.45,general text,,0,0,0,,she looked good in that dress
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.16,0:49:32.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Better than you in that blue cape
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.12,0:49:34.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Apparently you don’t like it
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.38,0:49:37.63,general text,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.71,0:49:40.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything here is like this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.42,0:49:42.46,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Nak Su's robe
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.55,0:49:43.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Whose?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.67,0:49:47.05,general text,,0,0,0,,The nomad Nak Su killed the magician Jeonbugwan in front of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.64,0:49:49.81,general text,,0,0,0,,She was wearing a similar robe
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.89,0:49:53.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Now everyone in the capital has this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.06,0:50:02.32,general text,,0,0,0,,- Come, buy Nak Su’s robe\N- I have one
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.40,0:50:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,This will protect your soul from being absorbed
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.24,0:50:05.65,general text,,0,0,0,,- This\N- Take
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.74,0:50:08.16,italics,,0,0,0,,I want this one
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.24,0:50:10.45,general text,,0,0,0,,- Cape Nak Su\N- Try it on
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.12,0:50:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Nomad in Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.33,0:50:20.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Everyone thinks Nak Soo has returned from the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.30,0:50:26.13,general text,,0,0,0,,But thanks to "Nak Su in Blue",
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.22,0:50:28.89,general text,,0,0,0,,nobody remembers the fight between Uka and the prince
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.05,0:50:32.01,general text,,0,0,0,,I wonder where Wook and Moo Deok are
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.14,0:50:34.52,general text,,0,0,0,,They were not in Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.39,0:50:36.85,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're fine
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.56,0:50:40.19,general text,,0,0,0,,They will be back in two weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.65,0:50:44.28,general text,,0,0,0,,By the way, Yul
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.86,0:50:48.57,general text,,0,0,0,,I bought it for myself too. Do you want to try it on?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.29,0:50:55.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.83,0:51:02.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.46,0:51:05.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Su in blue, owning Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.64,0:51:15.77,general text,,0,0,0,,You said this was the grave of the soulswallowers
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.35,0:51:18.94,general text,,0,0,0,,So it should be here
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.81,0:51:21.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Your father
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.90,0:51:25.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Baby
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.03,0:51:29.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I thought that he was killed by the magicians of the four families
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.49,0:51:34.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Jin Mu took me to him, I called him Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.20,0:51:35.24,general text,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.87,0:51:39.37,general text,,0,0,0,,my father was a nomad, he was used
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.08,0:51:43.38,general text,,0,0,0,,And they used me, then abandoned me
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.96,0:51:48.51,general text,,0,0,0,,As Kil Ju said,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.63,0:51:51.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I will petrify and die
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.22,0:51:57.64,general text,,0,0,0,,When I turn to stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.06,0:52:03.73,general text,,0,0,0,,will you bury me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.24,0:52:19.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I found out where the real Dan Zhu is
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.00,0:52:24.04,general text,,0,0,0,,In the palace. The real one is there
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.51,0:52:31.38,general text,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the ice stone
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.05,0:52:34.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Are you sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.93,0:52:38.18,general text,,0,0,0,,that it was destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.56,0:52:43.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Seo Kyung and the head of Jinyeowon 200 years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.06,0:52:47.65,general text,,0,0,0,,We are sure that he
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.23,0:52:50.69,general text,,0,0,0,,not in Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.88,0:53:13.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello, Dan Zhu
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.11,0:53:33.78,general text,,0,0,0,,Kil Ju wanted an ice stone, so he came to the palace to see me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.95,0:53:36.11,general text,,0,0,0,,I didn’t know,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.07,0:53:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,that Kil Ju knows who the real Dan Ju is
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.29,0:53:42.20,general text,,0,0,0,,The day the Choi family regains power,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.83,0:53:46.75,general text,,0,0,0,,and Sosnovy Bor, the cause of our fall, has been destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.75,0:53:51.96,general text,,0,0,0,,already very close. Then I will begin to rule in Daeho
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.72,0:53:56.26,general text,,0,0,0,,I look forward to this day no less than you
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.68,0:54:01.10,general text,,0,0,0,,We must find and kill the one who dealt with Kil Ju
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.60,0:54:05.06,general text,,0,0,0,,This man was probably waiting until Kil Ju
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.14,0:54:07.90,general text,,0,0,0,,will come to the palace for the stone
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.98,0:54:10.57,general text,,0,0,0,,If he knows where the stone is,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.07,0:54:12.44,general text,,0,0,0,,you must find
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.57,0:54:14.86,general text,,0,0,0,,and kill him
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.45,0:54:20.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t know who it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.95,0:54:23.91,general text,,0,0,0,,but the real Dan Zhu is in the palace and has a stone
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.00,0:54:26.71,general text,,0,0,0,,With its help, nomads do not turn into soul swallowers
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.79,0:54:32.05,general text,,0,0,0,,So, we need to get into the palace and find Dan Zhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.13,0:54:34.13,general text,,0,0,0,,This is impossible now
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.92,0:54:37.38,general text,,0,0,0,,I am a weak magician rejected by Jeongjingak
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.01,0:54:40.60,general text,,0,0,0,,But I will push forward
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.72,0:54:44.22,general text,,0,0,0,,And I will definitely get to the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.81,0:54:46.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.10,0:54:49.35,general text,,0,0,0,,I will find
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.40,0:54:51.77,general text,,0,0,0,,stone for you
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.28,0:54:58.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.20,0:55:01.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Your teacher is not strong enough to pull you up
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.62,0:55:05.29,general text,,0,0,0,,or cover from behind
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:10.13,general text,,0,0,0,,You have never been like this
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.67,0:55:12.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Always pushed me to death
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.76,0:55:19.68,italics,,0,0,0,,But after each time I became better and stronger than before
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.47,0:55:25.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Keep putting me in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.89,0:55:27.52,general text,,0,0,0,,The main thing is to be close
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.49,0:55:38.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.65,0:55:41.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I’ll be there and push you to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.87,0:55:44.20,general text,,0,0,0,,if you stop
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.73,0:56:14.81,general text,,0,0,0,,I'll find Uka and make sure he doesn't come to the fight
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.65,0:56:17.94,general text,,0,0,0,,No need
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.49,0:56:20.82,general text,,0,0,0,,If he wants to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.70,0:56:22.66,general text,,0,0,0,,let
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.74,0:56:25.41,general text,,0,0,0,,This is an official duel between magicians
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.16,0:56:28.37,general text,,0,0,0,,We will not be able to intervene even if one dies
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.50,0:56:32.25,general text,,0,0,0,,If someone dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.21,0:56:35.71,general text,,0,0,0,,so it will be so
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.13,0:56:41.67,general text,,0,0,0,,You won’t stop this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.64,0:56:48.31,general text,,0,0,0,,The Unified Council demanded from Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.39,0:56:50.48,general text,,0,0,0,,fight on behalf of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.39,0:56:53.31,general text,,0,0,0,,He will run away from cowardly
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.02,0:56:56.11,general text,,0,0,0,,and will die with honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.90,0:57:01.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I will only watch as the head of Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.91,0:58:38.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Their Lordships the King and Queen have arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.28,0:59:14.08,general text,,0,0,0,,A month ago Go Won, heir to the Daeho royal family,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.16,0:59:17.71,general text,,0,0,0,,challenged the eldest son of the Chan family to a duel
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.79,0:59:21.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Sosnovy Bor accepted the challenge on behalf of Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.13,0:59:24.17,italics,,0,0,0,,By signing this paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.25,0:59:26.46,general text,,0,0,0,,you agree not to make any claims
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.42,0:59:30.47,general text,,0,0,0,,even if someone dies
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.18,0:59:35.97,general text,,0,0,0,,The duel will begin at noon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.64,0:59:38.73,general text,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook doesn't show up before then,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.52,0:59:41.52,general text,,0,0,0,,we will take this as a defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.23,0:59:49.24,general text,,0,0,0,,You should mention the punishment he will receive if he doesn't show up
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.53,0:59:57.12,general text,,0,0,0,,If Chang Wook doesn't come today,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.91,1:00:02.00,general text,,0,0,0,,he will lose the right to become the next Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.92,1:00:05.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.44,1:00:27.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Come to me
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.11,1:00:30.95,general text,,0,0,0,,What's in those jugs?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.74,1:00:34.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Water
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.99,1:00:36.53,general text,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.23,1:01:11.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Chapter, it’s already noon
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.28,1:01:13.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Close the hall door
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.45,1:01:15.62,general text,,0,0,0,,I must
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.87,1:01:18.37,general text,,0,0,0,,announce his loss
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.43,1:01:39.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Close
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.40,1:01:55.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.00,1:02:05.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.61,1:02:37.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.20,1:02:40.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.75,1:02:47.08,inscriptions,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.39,1:03:09.35,general text,,0,0,0,,You signed the paper
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.44,1:03:10.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Now no one will interfere,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.69,1:03:13.69,general text,,0,0,0,,even if you die during the fight
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.90,1:03:16.07,general text,,0,0,0,,Got it
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.78,1:03:20.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.07,1:03:23.70,general text,,0,0,0,,stop this fight
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.45,1:03:27.25,general text,,0,0,0,,He will die by the hand of the Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.33,1:03:29.33,general text,,0,0,0,,He came because he was ready to die
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.42,1:03:32.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Your marriage has been dissolved again
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.21,1:03:34.96,general text,,0,0,0,,His fate has nothing to do with us
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.48,1:03:49.85,general text,,0,0,0,,You can start
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.05,1:04:21.26,memories italics,,0,0,0,,First: don’t attack, just defend yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.34,1:04:23.51,memories,,0,0,0,,Attack him with your skills -
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.05,1:04:26.22,memories,,0,0,0,,you will die
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.14,1:04:30.06,memories,,0,0,0,,You can only attack when he
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.23,1:04:32.81,memories,,0,0,0,,loses concentration
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.85,1:05:12.81,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he placed them
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.89,1:05:15.61,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Can you really go to Sosnovy Bor whenever you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.65,1:05:17.82,memories,,0,0,0,,Yes. And what?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.86,1:05:20.40,memories,,0,0,0,,I have a request
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.99,1:05:22.82,memories,,0,0,0,,You can place water in the training room,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.90,1:05:24.99,memories,,0,0,0,,so he could use Tansu?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.17,1:05:42.17,memories,,0,0,0,,These jugs of water confuse me
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.88,1:05:44.84,memories,,0,0,0,,Break them
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.65,1:06:45.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Host
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.37,1:06:58.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.43,1:07:17.39,general text,,0,0,0,,Prince...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.48,1:07:18.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Duel
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.10,1:07:20.27,general text,,0,0,0,,over
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.32,1:07:27.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Not fair. Doesn't count!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.50,1:07:39.04,general text,,0,0,0,,It was Tansu
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.96,1:07:42.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Only those who have mastered Chisu can master it
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.79,1:07:47.55,general text,,0,0,0,,How could Chan Wook, whose gate was opened only recently, take possession of him?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.63,1:07:48.97,general text,,0,0,0,,I'm sure,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.05,1:07:52.30,general text,,0,0,0,,that one of the masters helped him
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.39,1:07:55.51,italics,,0,0,0,,How would they help him,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.60,1:07:57.43,general text,,0,0,0,,if everyone watched?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.52,1:07:58.98,general text,,0,0,0,,Don’t talk nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.60,1:08:01.56,italics,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, answer
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.65,1:08:04.19,general text,,0,0,0,,You really mastered Chisa, and then Tansa
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.27,1:08:05.98,general text,,0,0,0,,in such a short time?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.53,1:08:08.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Not really
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.78,1:08:11.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I have poor energy control
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.86,1:08:14.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I can only use Tansa if there is water
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.70,1:08:17.41,general text,,0,0,0,,I only know how to cut water
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.50,1:08:19.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Who taught you this?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.58,1:08:23.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Someone should have helped you
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.96,1:08:28.01,general text,,0,0,0,,Nobody
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.92,1:08:30.97,general text,,0,0,0,,You look
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.68,1:08:33.14,general text,,0,0,0,,This is just funny
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.22,1:08:35.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Claims that he has mastered this skill himself
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.85,1:08:41.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I noticed jugs of water here
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.15,1:08:45.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Who put them?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.86,1:08:48.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Your teacher?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.57,1:08:52.03,general text,,0,0,0,,I studied myself
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.11,1:08:53.49,general text,,0,0,0,,I won’t fall for this!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.57,1:08:55.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook, explain yourself
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.91,1:09:02.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Who helped you train?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.17,1:09:13.26,italics,,0,0,0,,I put the jugs
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.90,1:09:27.48,general text,,0,0,0,,And I was with him
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.27,1:09:31.44,general text,,0,0,0,,Everything he said is true
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.11,1:09:36.28,general text,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.20,1:09:39.12,general text,,0,0,0,,How dare you interfere?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.20,1:09:40.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.04,1:09:43.71,general text,,0,0,0,,This is Hemp Master Li
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.79,1:09:45.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Seo Kyung's apprentice
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.58,1:09:47.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Greet him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.80,1:09:52.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Hello, master
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.47,1:09:58.89,general text,,0,0,0,,I was with him in Danhyangk and saw everything
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.97,1:10:01.68,general text,,0,0,0,,He spent days learning to chop drops of water
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.89,1:10:06.44,general text,,0,0,0,,And with it
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.94,1:10:10.32,general text,,0,0,0,,there was only his maid
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.36,1:10:15.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li vouched for him
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.45,1:10:21.91,general text,,0,0,0,,Are there any other objections?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.86,1:10:58.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Your Majesty
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.59,1:11:18.34,general text,,0,0,0,,Let Chan Wook enter Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.48,1:11:34.90,general text,,0,0,0,,No wonder Gwangju Chang Gan’s son is so talented
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.98,1:11:40.03,general text,,0,0,0,,Since you don’t have a teacher yet, Jeonbugwan will gladly accept you
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.82,1:11:42.70,general text,,0,0,0,,I don’t need it here!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.78,1:11:45.12,general text,,0,0,0,,I should be his teacher
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.20,1:11:48.33,general text,,0,0,0,,I opened his gates, and it was I who gave him my energy
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.41,1:11:50.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Uk, come with me to Sejukwon
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.92,1:11:53.21,general text,,0,0,0,,I will teach you everything I know
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.29,1:11:55.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Or maybe in Jinyoewon?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.30,1:11:59.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Engagement with Cho Young is broken,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.22,1:12:02.47,general text,,0,0,0,,but we will consider you family and teach you our spells
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.93,1:12:08.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Chan Wook,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.02,1:12:11.27,general text,,0,0,0,,if you want, you can join Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.98,1:12:14.27,general text,,0,0,0,,We will accept you
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.46,1:12:34.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.67,1:12:38.42,general text,,0,0,0,,everyone calls me. Where to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.89,1:12:52.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Enter Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.56,1:12:54.69,general text,,0,0,0,,host
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.70,1:13:06.78,general text,,0,0,0,,I, Chan Wook, the eldest son of the Chan family,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.58,1:13:09.66,general text,,0,0,0,,I will enter Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.79,1:14:09.92,preview,,0,0,0,,The master became the magician of Jeonjingak
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.01,1:14:13.22,preview,,0,0,0,,Welcome our new magician Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.88,1:14:16.05,preview,,0,0,0,,I hate your master until I grind my teeth
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.14,1:14:17.05,preview,,0,0,0,,Of course
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.81,1:14:22.06,preview,,0,0,0,,If this love is so fickle, then I don’t need it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.14,1:14:23.10,preview,,0,0,0,,Let me in
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.19,1:14:24.02,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.10,1:14:26.44,preview,,0,0,0,,I must be with the owner
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.52,1:14:27.65,preview,,0,0,0,,Go home, wait there
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.73,1:14:30.07,preview,,0,0,0,,Mr. Chan got out and went home
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.82,1:14:32.70,preview,,0,0,0,,Master! Wait there
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.78,1:14:34.95,preview,,0,0,0,,- I’m coming to you\N- I found the questions for the exam
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.61,1:14:36.87,preview,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.95,1:14:39.37,preview,,0,0,0,,I’ll get to Sosnovy Bor to the owner
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.45,1:14:40.66,preview,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.74,1:14:43.75,preview,,0,0,0,,I can handle anything just to see you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.14,0:02:59.14,preview,,0,0,0,,

